{"id":57337,"date":"2026-08-06T10:43:26","date_gmt":"2026-08-06T09:43:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-entre-pontes-tavira\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T20:05:39","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T19:05:39","slug":"corrida-entre-pontes-tavira","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-entre-pontes-tavira\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Entre Pontes \u2013 Tavira 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Entre Pontes \u2013 Tavira 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida Entre Pontes \u2013 Tavira 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 um dos mais tradicionais e c\u00e9nicos eventos de atletismo de estrada do sotavento algarvio, realizando-se no domingo, <strong>20 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na encantadora cidade de <strong>Tavira<\/strong>. Com partida e chegada na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica<\/strong>, o evento percorre as duas margens do Rio Gil\u00e3o, atravessando as pontes hist\u00f3ricas da localidade num tra\u00e7ado de <strong>10.300 metros<\/strong> r\u00e1pido, din\u00e2mico e rodeado pelo patrim\u00f3nio arquitet\u00f3nico algarvio.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>Clube de Vela de Tavira<\/strong>, com o apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Tavira<\/strong> e a chancela t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve (AAALG)<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o acolhe atletas federados e populares desde os escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o (Sub-10 a Sub-18) at\u00e9 veteranos. A prova rainha de 10,3 km conta com pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para o top 5 geral masculino e feminino, meta volante ao km 4,3 junto \u00e0 Ponte de S\u00e3o Domingos, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos aos 5 km e na meta, bem como um completo kit de atleta com t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e medalha de participa\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica, Tavira, Faro<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10,3 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Clube de Vela de Tavira<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Principal (10.300 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 20 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:45<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Consultar no portal oficial<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Jovem<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Iniciados e Juvenis (Sub-16 e Sub-18)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 20 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:50<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito \/ Escal\u00f5es Jovens<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Jovem<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Benjamins B e Infantis (Sub-12 e Sub-14)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 20 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito \/ Escal\u00f5es Jovens<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Jovem<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Benjamins A (Sub-10)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 20 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito \/ Escal\u00f5es Jovens<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida Entre Pontes Tavira 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 20 de setembro de 2026, com secretariado, partida e meta instalados na Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica, em Tavira. O programa de corridas inicia-se \u00e0s 09h30 com os escal\u00f5es jovens e \u00e0s 09h45 para a corrida principal de 10,3 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e escal\u00f5es dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa contempla a corrida principal de 10.300 metros (Juniores a Veteranos VIII) e provas para escal\u00f5es jovens: Benjamins A \/ Sub-10 (550 m), Benjamins B e Infantis \/ Sub-12 e Sub-14 (1.100 m), e Iniciados e Juvenis \/ Sub-16 e Sub-18 (1.920 m).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e a que horas podem ser levantados os dorsais e o kit de atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os dorsais e o kit de participante podem ser levantados no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova, no secretariado situado junto \u00e0 Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica, entre as 07h30 e as 09h00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existem abastecimentos previstos ao longo da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, na prova de 10.300 metros haver\u00e1 um ponto de abastecimento l\u00edquido aos 5 km de percurso, al\u00e9m de abastecimento s\u00f3lido e l\u00edquido na zona de meta para todos os atletas que concluam a prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">H\u00e1 pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios na Corrida Entre Pontes?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. Na dist\u00e2ncia de 10.300 metros s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos cinco primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina (200\u20ac, 150\u20ac, 100\u20ac, 75\u20ac e 50\u20ac), al\u00e9m de um cabaz de 50\u20ac para o primeiro atleta de cada g\u00e9nero a cruzar a meta volante ao km 4,3 na Ponte de S\u00e3o Domingos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida Entre Pontes \u2013 Tavira 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-20\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica, Tavira\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Tavira\", \"addressRegion\": \"Faro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Clube de Vela de Tavira\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida Entre Pontes Tavira 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 20 de setembro de 2026, com secretariado, partida e meta instalados na Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica, em Tavira. O programa de corridas inicia-se \u00e0s 09h30 com os escal\u00f5es jovens e \u00e0s 09h45 para a corrida principal de 10,3 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e escal\u00f5es dispon\u00edveis no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa contempla a corrida principal de 10.300 metros (Juniores a Veteranos VIII) e provas para escal\u00f5es jovens: Benjamins A \/ Sub-10 (550 m), Benjamins B e Infantis \/ Sub-12 e Sub-14 (1.100 m), e Iniciados e Juvenis \/ Sub-16 e Sub-18 (1.920 m).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e a que horas podem ser levantados os dorsais e o kit de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os dorsais e o kit de participante podem ser levantados no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova, no secretariado situado junto \u00e0 Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica, entre as 07h30 e as 09h00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existem abastecimentos previstos ao longo da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, na prova de 10.300 metros haver\u00e1 um ponto de abastecimento l\u00edquido aos 5 km de percurso, al\u00e9m de abastecimento s\u00f3lido e l\u00edquido na zona de meta para todos os atletas que concluam a prova.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"H\u00e1 pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios na Corrida Entre Pontes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim. Na dist\u00e2ncia de 10.300 metros s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos cinco primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina (200\u20ac, 150\u20ac, 100\u20ac, 75\u20ac e 50\u20ac), al\u00e9m de um cabaz de 50\u20ac para o primeiro atleta de cada g\u00e9nero a cruzar a meta volante ao km 4,3 na Ponte de S\u00e3o Domingos.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":57338,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,478],"event_type_2":[728,149,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-57337","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-tavira-far